      "originalName": "Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel",
      "year": 2014,
      "igdbId": 6032,
      "popularity": 432,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "best_version",
          "value": "17355",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Shoot 'n' loot your way through a brand new adventure that rockets you onto Pandora's moon in Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel. Discover the story behind Borderlands 2’s villain, Handsome Jack, and his rise to power in this brand new game in the Borderlands series. Taking place between the original Borderlands and Borderlands 2, the Pre-Sequel gives you a whole lotta new gameplay featuring the genre fusion of shooter and RPG gameplay that players can’t get enough of.\n\nGet high in low gravity and launch across the moonscape to take enemies down from above using new ice and laser weapons. Catch-a-ride on the lunar landscape with new vehicles equipped with deadly weapons allowing for more levels of destructive mayhem. So grab a friend (or two, or three), strap on a rocket, and take off on a brand new Borderlands adventure",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Dispara y saquea en una aventura completamente nueva que te lanza a la luna de Pandora en Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel! Descubre la historia detrás del villano de Borderlands 2, Handsome Jack, y su ascenso al poder en este juego totalmente nuevo de la serie Borderlands. Ambientado entre el Borderlands original y Borderlands 2, The Pre-Sequel te ofrece una enorme cantidad de jugabilidad nueva, con la fusión de géneros de shooter y RPG que tanto gusta a los jugadores.\n\nSalta muy alto en la baja gravedad y lánzate sobre el paisaje lunar para abatir enemigos desde arriba con las nuevas armas de hielo y láser. Súbete a vehículos nuevos del paisaje lunar, equipados con armas letales que permiten niveles aún mayores de caos destructivo. Así que reúne a un amigo (o a dos, o a tres), equípate con un cohete y emprende una nueva aventura de Borderlands.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2014",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
